  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: We were transporting the object as instructed, inside the sealed\ncontainer,
    when one of the reefs collapsed. We were prepared for such\nsituations, but the
    container was too large to handle comfortably and\ngot damaged while we moved
    to safety. The second water touched the\nobject, it began moving and emitting
    a red light, followed by a\nscreeching sound.\nWe tried to go back to the surface
    to prevent further damage, but the\norder was given to completely cover the object
    and rush to Prubei\nlaboratory.\nI can not figure out what that thing was, but
    I do know one thing. It is\nnot ours.
